        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Low concentrations of ampicillin and sulbactam are excreted in the milk; therefore, caution should be exercised when Ampicillin and Sulbactam for Injection is administered to a nursing woman.",
